{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","section":{"24":"The Book of Hajj"},"section_detail":{"24":{"hadithnumber_first":2619,"hadithnumber_last":3084,"arabicnumber_first":2619,"arabicnumber_last":3084,"name_native":"كتاب الحج"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2730,"arabicnumber":2730,"text":"اخبرنا هناد بن السري، عن ابي الاحوص، عن ابي اسحاق، عن ابي اسماء، عن انس، قال سمعت رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم يلبي بهما","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":24,"hadith":112}}]}